### Frozen PATTERN_V1 configuration (simulation only)
GET http://localhost:8081/api/backtest/pattern-v1/configuration

### PATTERN_V1 COST TEST (riskPercent uses general configuration; default 2%)
POST http://localhost:8081/api/backtest/pattern-v1/run
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "startDate": "2010-01-01",
  "initialCapital": 10000,
  "maxOrderValue": 6000,
  "maxQuantity": 100000,
  "slippagePercent": 0.03,
  "commission": {
    "model": "IBKR_US_FIXED",
    "perShare": 0.005,
    "minimumPerOrder": 1.00,
    "maximumPercentOrderValue": 1
  }
}

### Entire CORE, from 2010 to last available completed daily bar
POST http://localhost:8081/api/backtest/pattern-v1/run
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "startDate": "2010-01-01",
  "timeframe": "DAILY",
  "initialCapital": 10000,
  "commissionPerOrder": 0,
  "slippagePercent": 0
}

### Single symbol; targets and directions always come from YAML
POST http://localhost:8081/api/backtest/pattern-v1/run
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "symbols": ["AAPL"],
  "startDate": "2010-01-01",
  "endDate": "2026-09-08",
  "timeframe": "DAILY",
  "initialCapital": 10000
}

### Replace with backtestId from the response
GET http://localhost:8081/api/backtest/pattern-v1/{{backtestId}}

### Excel: SUMMARY, SYMBOL_RESULTS, TRADES, EQUITY_CURVE, CONFIGURATION
GET http://localhost:8081/api/backtest/pattern-v1/{{backtestId}}/export/excel
